## Liquidity

High quality liquid assets over thirty day outflows at the stated run rates of
{{ v('policy.outflow_rate_checking') }} for checking, {{ v('policy.outflow_rate_savings') }} for
savings and {{ v('policy.outflow_rate_time') }} for time deposits: {{ v('f08.lcr') }}, and
{{ v('f08.lcr_concentration') }} if the largest one percent of depositors also left in full.
Not the regulatory ratio: no inflows, no level two haircuts, no committed lines.
